{"boek":"zefanja","inhoudelijke_controle_voltooid":false,"verzen":53,"koppelingen":756,"verzen_zonder_grondtekst":0,"verzen_zonder_koppelingslaag":0,"fouten":[],"woorden_zonder_link":[{"ref":"zefanja/1/1","tekst":"Het woord van JAHWEH, dat gebeurd is tot Zefanja, de zoon van Cuschi, de zoon van Gedalja, de zoon van Amarja, de zoon van Hizkia; in de dagen van Josia, de zoon van Amon, de koning van Juda.","woorden":[{"woord":"Het","start":0,"eind":3},{"woord":"van","start":10,"eind":13},{"woord":"is","start":34,"eind":36},{"woord":"de","start":50,"eind":52},{"woord":"van","start":58,"eind":61},{"woord":"de","start":70,"eind":72},{"woord":"van","start":78,"eind":81},{"woord":"de","start":91,"eind":93},{"woord":"van","start":99,"eind":102},{"woord":"de","start":111,"eind":113},{"woord":"van","start":119,"eind":122},{"woord":"in","start":131,"eind":133},{"woord":"de","start":134,"eind":136},{"woord":"van","start":143,"eind":146},{"woord":"de","start":154,"eind":156},{"woord":"van","start":162,"eind":165},{"woord":"de","start":172,"eind":174},{"woord":"van","start":182,"eind":185}]},{"ref":"zefanja/1/2","tekst":"Ik zal geheel alles wegrapen uit dit land, spreekt JAHWEH.","woorden":[{"woord":"Ik","start":0,"eind":2},{"woord":"zal","start":3,"eind":6},{"woord":"dit","start":33,"eind":36}]},{"ref":"zefanja/1/3","tekst":"Ik zal wegrapen mensen en beesten; Ik zal wegrapen de vogels van de hemel, en de vissen van de zee, en de struikelblokken met de goddelozen; ja, Ik zal de mensen uit dit land uitroeien, spreekt JAHWEH.","woorden":[{"woord":"Ik","start":0,"eind":2},{"woord":"zal","start":3,"eind":6},{"woord":"en","start":23,"eind":25},{"woord":"Ik","start":35,"eind":37},{"woord":"zal","start":38,"eind":41},{"woord":"de","start":51,"eind":53},{"woord":"van","start":61,"eind":64},{"woord":"de","start":65,"eind":67},{"woord":"en","start":75,"eind":77},{"woord":"de","start":78,"eind":80},{"woord":"van","start":88,"eind":91},{"woord":"de","start":92,"eind":94},{"woord":"en","start":100,"eind":102},{"woord":"de","start":103,"eind":105},{"woord":"de","start":126,"eind":128},{"woord":"ja","start":141,"eind":143},{"woord":"Ik","start":145,"eind":147},{"woord":"zal","start":148,"eind":151},{"woord":"de","start":152,"eind":154},{"woord":"dit","start":166,"eind":169}]},{"ref":"zefanja/1/4","tekst":" En Ik zal Mijn hand uitstrekken tegen Juda, en tegen alle inwoners van Jeruzalem; en Ik zal uit deze plaats uitroeien het overblijfsel van Baäl, en de naam van de Chemarim met de priesters;","woorden":[{"woord":"En","start":1,"eind":3},{"woord":"Ik","start":4,"eind":6},{"woord":"zal","start":7,"eind":10},{"woord":"Mijn","start":11,"eind":15},{"woord":"en","start":45,"eind":47},{"woord":"van","start":68,"eind":71},{"woord":"en","start":83,"eind":85},{"woord":"Ik","start":86,"eind":88},{"woord":"zal","start":89,"eind":92},{"woord":"het","start":119,"eind":122},{"woord":"van","start":136,"eind":139},{"woord":"en","start":146,"eind":148},{"woord":"de","start":149,"eind":151},{"woord":"van","start":157,"eind":160},{"woord":"de","start":161,"eind":163},{"woord":"de","start":177,"eind":179}]},{"ref":"zefanja/1/5","tekst":" En die zich neerbuigen op de daken voor het leger van de hemel, en die zich neerbuigende zweren bij JAHWEH, en zweren bij Malcham;","woorden":[{"woord":"En","start":1,"eind":3},{"woord":"die","start":4,"eind":7},{"woord":"zich","start":8,"eind":12},{"woord":"de","start":27,"eind":29},{"woord":"voor","start":36,"eind":40},{"woord":"het","start":41,"eind":44},{"woord":"van","start":51,"eind":54},{"woord":"de","start":55,"eind":57},{"woord":"en","start":65,"eind":67},{"woord":"die","start":68,"eind":71},{"woord":"zich","start":72,"eind":76},{"woord":"bij","start":97,"eind":100},{"woord":"en","start":109,"eind":111},{"woord":"bij","start":119,"eind":122}]},{"ref":"zefanja/1/6","tekst":"En die terugkeren van achter JAHWEH; en die JAHWEH niet zoeken, en vragen naar Hem niet.","woorden":[{"woord":"En","start":0,"eind":2},{"woord":"die","start":3,"eind":6},{"woord":"van","start":18,"eind":21},{"woord":"en","start":37,"eind":39},{"woord":"en","start":64,"eind":66},{"woord":"naar","start":74,"eind":78},{"woord":"Hem","start":79,"eind":82}]},{"ref":"zefanja/1/7","tekst":" Zwijg voor het aangezicht van de Heere JAHWEH; want de dag van JAHWEH is nabij; want JAHWEH heeft een slachtoffer bereid, Hij heeft Zijn genodigden geheiligd.","woorden":[{"woord":"voor","start":7,"eind":11},{"woord":"het","start":12,"eind":15},{"woord":"van","start":27,"eind":30},{"woord":"de","start":31,"eind":33},{"woord":"de","start":53,"eind":55},{"woord":"van","start":60,"eind":63},{"woord":"is","start":71,"eind":73},{"woord":"heeft","start":93,"eind":98},{"woord":"een","start":99,"eind":102},{"woord":"Hij","start":123,"eind":126},{"woord":"heeft","start":127,"eind":132},{"woord":"Zijn","start":133,"eind":137}]},{"ref":"zefanja/1/8","tekst":"En het zal gebeuren in de dag van het slachtoffer van JAHWEH, dat Ik bezoeking zal doen over de vorsten, en over de kinderen van de koning, en over allen, die zich kleden met vreemde kleding.","woorden":[{"woord":"En","start":0,"eind":2},{"woord":"het","start":3,"eind":6},{"woord":"zal","start":7,"eind":10},{"woord":"in","start":20,"eind":22},{"woord":"de","start":23,"eind":25},{"woord":"van","start":30,"eind":33},{"woord":"het","start":34,"eind":37},{"woord":"van","start":50,"eind":53},{"woord":"dat","start":62,"eind":65},{"woord":"Ik","start":66,"eind":68},{"woord":"zal","start":79,"eind":82},{"woord":"doen","start":83,"eind":87},{"woord":"de","start":93,"eind":95},{"woord":"en","start":105,"eind":107},{"woord":"de","start":113,"eind":115},{"woord":"van","start":125,"eind":128},{"woord":"de","start":129,"eind":131},{"woord":"en","start":140,"eind":142},{"woord":"die","start":155,"eind":158},{"woord":"zich","start":159,"eind":163},{"woord":"met","start":171,"eind":174}]},{"ref":"zefanja/1/9","tekst":"Ook zal Ik op diezelfde dag bezoeking doen over al wie over de dorpel springt; die het huis van hun heren vullen met geweld en bedrog.","woorden":[{"woord":"Ook","start":0,"eind":3},{"woord":"zal","start":4,"eind":7},{"woord":"Ik","start":8,"eind":10},{"woord":"op","start":11,"eind":13},{"woord":"doen","start":38,"eind":42},{"woord":"wie","start":51,"eind":54},{"woord":"de","start":60,"eind":62},{"woord":"die","start":79,"eind":82},{"woord":"het","start":83,"eind":86},{"woord":"van","start":92,"eind":95},{"woord":"hun","start":96,"eind":99},{"woord":"met","start":113,"eind":116},{"woord":"en","start":124,"eind":126}]},{"ref":"zefanja/1/10","tekst":"En er zal op die dag, spreekt JAHWEH, een stem van het gekrijt zijn van de Vispoort af, en een gehuil van het tweede gedeelte, en een grote breuk van de heuvelen af.","woorden":[{"woord":"En","start":0,"eind":2},{"woord":"er","start":3,"eind":5},{"woord":"zal","start":6,"eind":9},{"woord":"op","start":10,"eind":12},{"woord":"een","start":38,"eind":41},{"woord":"van","start":47,"eind":50},{"woord":"het","start":51,"eind":54},{"woord":"van","start":68,"eind":71},{"woord":"de","start":72,"eind":74},{"woord":"af","start":84,"eind":86},{"woord":"en","start":88,"eind":90},{"woord":"een","start":91,"eind":94},{"woord":"het","start":106,"eind":109},{"woord":"en","start":127,"eind":129},{"woord":"een","start":130,"eind":133},{"woord":"van","start":146,"eind":149},{"woord":"de","start":150,"eind":152},{"woord":"af","start":162,"eind":164}]},{"ref":"zefanja/1/11","tekst":"Huil, u inwoners van de laagte! Want al het volk van koophandel is uitgehouwen, al de gelddragers zijn uitgeroeid.","woorden":[{"woord":"u","start":6,"eind":7},{"woord":"van","start":17,"eind":20},{"woord":"de","start":21,"eind":23},{"woord":"het","start":40,"eind":43},{"woord":"van","start":49,"eind":52},{"woord":"is","start":64,"eind":66},{"woord":"de","start":83,"eind":85},{"woord":"zijn","start":98,"eind":102}]},{"ref":"zefanja/1/12","tekst":"En het zal gebeuren in die tijd, Ik zal Jeruzalem met lantaarnen doorzoeken; en Ik zal bezoeking doen over de mannen, die stijf geworden zijn op hun droesem, die in hun hart zeggen: JAHWEH doet geen goed, en Hij doet geen kwaad.","woorden":[{"woord":"En","start":0,"eind":2},{"woord":"het","start":3,"eind":6},{"woord":"zal","start":7,"eind":10},{"woord":"in","start":20,"eind":22},{"woord":"Ik","start":33,"eind":35},{"woord":"zal","start":36,"eind":39},{"woord":"met","start":50,"eind":53},{"woord":"en","start":77,"eind":79},{"woord":"Ik","start":80,"eind":82},{"woord":"zal","start":83,"eind":86},{"woord":"doen","start":97,"eind":101},{"woord":"de","start":107,"eind":109},{"woord":"die","start":118,"eind":121},{"woord":"geworden","start":128,"eind":136},{"woord":"zijn","start":137,"eind":141},{"woord":"hun","start":145,"eind":148},{"woord":"die","start":158,"eind":161},{"woord":"in","start":162,"eind":164},{"woord":"hun","start":165,"eind":168},{"woord":"doet","start":189,"eind":193},{"woord":"en","start":205,"eind":207},{"woord":"Hij","start":208,"eind":211},{"woord":"doet","start":212,"eind":216}]},{"ref":"zefanja/1/13","tekst":"Daarom zal hun vermogen ten roof worden, en hun huizen tot verwoesting; zij bouwen wel huizen, maar zij zullen ze niet bewonen; en zij planten wijngaarden, maar zij zullen van die wijn niet drinken.","woorden":[{"woord":"Daarom","start":0,"eind":6},{"woord":"zal","start":7,"eind":10},{"woord":"hun","start":11,"eind":14},{"woord":"ten","start":24,"eind":27},{"woord":"en","start":41,"eind":43},{"woord":"hun","start":44,"eind":47},{"woord":"tot","start":55,"eind":58},{"woord":"zij","start":72,"eind":75},{"woord":"wel","start":83,"eind":86},{"woord":"maar","start":95,"eind":99},{"woord":"zij","start":100,"eind":103},{"woord":"zullen","start":104,"eind":110},{"woord":"ze","start":111,"eind":113},{"woord":"en","start":128,"eind":130},{"woord":"zij","start":131,"eind":134},{"woord":"maar","start":156,"eind":160},{"woord":"zij","start":161,"eind":164},{"woord":"zullen","start":165,"eind":171},{"woord":"van","start":172,"eind":175},{"woord":"die","start":176,"eind":179}]},{"ref":"zefanja/1/14","tekst":" De grote dag van JAHWEH is nabij; hij is nabij, en zeer haastende; de stem van de dag van JAHWEH; de held zal daar bitter schreeuwen.","woorden":[{"woord":"De","start":1,"eind":3},{"woord":"van","start":14,"eind":17},{"woord":"is","start":25,"eind":27},{"woord":"hij","start":35,"eind":38},{"woord":"is","start":39,"eind":41},{"woord":"en","start":49,"eind":51},{"woord":"de","start":68,"eind":70},{"woord":"van","start":76,"eind":79},{"woord":"de","start":80,"eind":82},{"woord":"van","start":87,"eind":90},{"woord":"de","start":99,"eind":101},{"woord":"zal","start":107,"eind":110}]},{"ref":"zefanja/1/15","tekst":"Die dag zal een dag van de toorn zijn; een dag van de benauwdheid en van de angst, een dag van de woestheid en verwoesting, een dag van de duisternis en van de donkerheid, een dag van de wolk en van de dikke donkerheid;","woorden":[{"woord":"zal","start":8,"eind":11},{"woord":"een","start":12,"eind":15},{"woord":"van","start":20,"eind":23},{"woord":"de","start":24,"eind":26},{"woord":"zijn","start":33,"eind":37},{"woord":"een","start":39,"eind":42},{"woord":"van","start":47,"eind":50},{"woord":"de","start":51,"eind":53},{"woord":"en","start":66,"eind":68},{"woord":"van","start":69,"eind":72},{"woord":"de","start":73,"eind":75},{"woord":"een","start":83,"eind":86},{"woord":"van","start":91,"eind":94},{"woord":"de","start":95,"eind":97},{"woord":"en","start":108,"eind":110},{"woord":"een","start":124,"eind":127},{"woord":"van","start":132,"eind":135},{"woord":"de","start":136,"eind":138},{"woord":"en","start":150,"eind":152},{"woord":"van","start":153,"eind":156},{"woord":"de","start":157,"eind":159},{"woord":"een","start":172,"eind":175},{"woord":"van","start":180,"eind":183},{"woord":"de","start":184,"eind":186},{"woord":"en","start":192,"eind":194},{"woord":"van","start":195,"eind":198},{"woord":"de","start":199,"eind":201}]},{"ref":"zefanja/1/16","tekst":" Een dag van de bazuin en van het geklank tegen de versterkte steden en tegen de hoge hoeken.","woorden":[{"woord":"Een","start":1,"eind":4},{"woord":"van","start":9,"eind":12},{"woord":"de","start":13,"eind":15},{"woord":"en","start":23,"eind":25},{"woord":"van","start":26,"eind":29},{"woord":"het","start":30,"eind":33},{"woord":"de","start":48,"eind":50},{"woord":"en","start":69,"eind":71},{"woord":"de","start":78,"eind":80}]},{"ref":"zefanja/1/17","tekst":"En Ik zal de mensen bang maken, dat zij zullen gaan als de blinden; want zij hebben tegen JAHWEH gezondigd; en hun bloed zal vergoten worden als stof, en hun vlees zal worden als mest.","woorden":[{"woord":"En","start":0,"eind":2},{"woord":"Ik","start":3,"eind":5},{"woord":"zal","start":6,"eind":9},{"woord":"de","start":10,"eind":12},{"woord":"maken","start":25,"eind":30},{"woord":"dat","start":32,"eind":35},{"woord":"zij","start":36,"eind":39},{"woord":"zullen","start":40,"eind":46},{"woord":"als","start":52,"eind":55},{"woord":"de","start":56,"eind":58},{"woord":"zij","start":73,"eind":76},{"woord":"hebben","start":77,"eind":83},{"woord":"tegen","start":84,"eind":89},{"woord":"en","start":108,"eind":110},{"woord":"hun","start":111,"eind":114},{"woord":"zal","start":121,"eind":124},{"woord":"worden","start":134,"eind":140},{"woord":"als","start":141,"eind":144},{"woord":"en","start":151,"eind":153},{"woord":"hun","start":154,"eind":157},{"woord":"zal","start":164,"eind":167},{"woord":"worden","start":168,"eind":174},{"woord":"als","start":175,"eind":178}]},{"ref":"zefanja/1/18","tekst":"Noch hun zilver, noch hun goud zal hen kunnen redden op de dag van de toorn van JAHWEH; maar door het vuur van Zijn ijver zal dit hele land verteerd worden; want Hij zal een voleinding maken, zeker, een haastige, met al de inwoners van dit land.","woorden":[{"woord":"hun","start":5,"eind":8},{"woord":"hun","start":22,"eind":25},{"woord":"zal","start":31,"eind":34},{"woord":"hen","start":35,"eind":38},{"woord":"op","start":53,"eind":55},{"woord":"de","start":56,"eind":58},{"woord":"van","start":63,"eind":66},{"woord":"de","start":67,"eind":69},{"woord":"van","start":76,"eind":79},{"woord":"maar","start":88,"eind":92},{"woord":"door","start":93,"eind":97},{"woord":"het","start":98,"eind":101},{"woord":"van","start":107,"eind":110},{"woord":"Zijn","start":111,"eind":115},{"woord":"zal","start":122,"eind":125},{"woord":"dit","start":126,"eind":129},{"woord":"worden","start":149,"eind":155},{"woord":"Hij","start":162,"eind":165},{"woord":"zal","start":166,"eind":169},{"woord":"een","start":170,"eind":173},{"woord":"een","start":199,"eind":202},{"woord":"de","start":220,"eind":222},{"woord":"van","start":232,"eind":235},{"woord":"dit","start":236,"eind":239}]},{"ref":"zefanja/2/1","tekst":" Doorzoek u zelf nauw, ja, doorzoek nauw, u volk, dat met geen lust bevangen wordt!","woorden":[{"woord":"u","start":10,"eind":11},{"woord":"zelf","start":12,"eind":16},{"woord":"nauw","start":17,"eind":21},{"woord":"ja","start":23,"eind":25},{"woord":"nauw","start":36,"eind":40},{"woord":"u","start":42,"eind":43},{"woord":"dat","start":50,"eind":53},{"woord":"met","start":54,"eind":57},{"woord":"bevangen","start":68,"eind":76},{"woord":"wordt","start":77,"eind":82}]},{"ref":"zefanja/2/2","tekst":" Voordat het besluit bare (gelijk kaf gaat de dag voorbij), terwijl de hitte van de toorn van JAHWEH over u nog niet komt; terwijl de dag van de toorn van JAHWEH over u nog niet komt.","woorden":[{"woord":"het","start":9,"eind":12},{"woord":"gelijk","start":27,"eind":33},{"woord":"gaat","start":38,"eind":42},{"woord":"de","start":43,"eind":45},{"woord":"de","start":68,"eind":70},{"woord":"van","start":77,"eind":80},{"woord":"de","start":81,"eind":83},{"woord":"van","start":90,"eind":93},{"woord":"nog","start":108,"eind":111},{"woord":"de","start":131,"eind":133},{"woord":"van","start":138,"eind":141},{"woord":"de","start":142,"eind":144},{"woord":"van","start":151,"eind":154},{"woord":"nog","start":169,"eind":172}]},{"ref":"zefanja/2/3","tekst":"Zoek JAHWEH, alle u zachtmoedigen van het land, die Zijn recht werken! Zoek gerechtigheid, zoekt zachtmoedigheid, misschien zult u verborgen worden in de dag van de toorn van JAHWEH.","woorden":[{"woord":"u","start":18,"eind":19},{"woord":"van","start":34,"eind":37},{"woord":"het","start":38,"eind":41},{"woord":"Zijn","start":52,"eind":56},{"woord":"zult","start":124,"eind":128},{"woord":"u","start":129,"eind":130},{"woord":"worden","start":141,"eind":147},{"woord":"in","start":148,"eind":150},{"woord":"de","start":151,"eind":153},{"woord":"van","start":158,"eind":161},{"woord":"de","start":162,"eind":164},{"woord":"van","start":171,"eind":174}]},{"ref":"zefanja/2/4","tekst":" Want Gaza zal verlaten wezen, en Askelon zal ter verwoesting wezen; Asdod zal men in de middag verdrijven, en Ekron zal uitgeworteld worden.","woorden":[{"woord":"zal","start":11,"eind":14},{"woord":"en","start":31,"eind":33},{"woord":"zal","start":42,"eind":45},{"woord":"ter","start":46,"eind":49},{"woord":"wezen","start":62,"eind":67},{"woord":"zal","start":75,"eind":78},{"woord":"men","start":79,"eind":82},{"woord":"in","start":83,"eind":85},{"woord":"de","start":86,"eind":88},{"woord":"en","start":108,"eind":110},{"woord":"zal","start":117,"eind":120},{"woord":"worden","start":134,"eind":140}]},{"ref":"zefanja/2/5","tekst":"Wee de inwoners van de landstreek van de zee, de volken van de Cheretim! Het woord van JAHWEH zal tegen u zijn, u Kanaän, van de Filistijnen land! en Ik zal u verdoen, dat er geen inwoner zal zijn.","woorden":[{"woord":"de","start":4,"eind":6},{"woord":"van","start":16,"eind":19},{"woord":"de","start":20,"eind":22},{"woord":"van","start":34,"eind":37},{"woord":"de","start":38,"eind":40},{"woord":"de","start":46,"eind":48},{"woord":"van","start":56,"eind":59},{"woord":"de","start":60,"eind":62},{"woord":"Het","start":73,"eind":76},{"woord":"van","start":83,"eind":86},{"woord":"zal","start":94,"eind":97},{"woord":"zijn","start":106,"eind":110},{"woord":"u","start":112,"eind":113},{"woord":"van","start":122,"eind":125},{"woord":"de","start":126,"eind":128},{"woord":"en","start":147,"eind":149},{"woord":"Ik","start":150,"eind":152},{"woord":"zal","start":153,"eind":156},{"woord":"u","start":157,"eind":158},{"woord":"dat","start":168,"eind":171},{"woord":"er","start":172,"eind":174},{"woord":"zal","start":188,"eind":191},{"woord":"zijn","start":192,"eind":196}]},{"ref":"zefanja/2/6","tekst":"En de landstreek van de zee zal wezen tot hutten, uitgegraven putten van de herder, en betuiningen van de kudden.","woorden":[{"woord":"En","start":0,"eind":2},{"woord":"de","start":3,"eind":5},{"woord":"van","start":17,"eind":20},{"woord":"de","start":21,"eind":23},{"woord":"zal","start":28,"eind":31},{"woord":"tot","start":38,"eind":41},{"woord":"van","start":69,"eind":72},{"woord":"de","start":73,"eind":75},{"woord":"en","start":84,"eind":86},{"woord":"van","start":99,"eind":102},{"woord":"de","start":103,"eind":105}]},{"ref":"zefanja/2/7","tekst":"En de landstreek zal wezen voor het overblijfsel van het huis van Juda, dat zij daarin weiden; 's avonds zullen zij in de huizen van Askelon legeren, als JAHWEH, hun God, hen zal bezocht, en hun gevangenis zal gewend hebben.","woorden":[{"woord":"En","start":0,"eind":2},{"woord":"de","start":3,"eind":5},{"woord":"zal","start":17,"eind":20},{"woord":"voor","start":27,"eind":31},{"woord":"het","start":32,"eind":35},{"woord":"van","start":49,"eind":52},{"woord":"het","start":53,"eind":56},{"woord":"van","start":62,"eind":65},{"woord":"dat","start":72,"eind":75},{"woord":"zij","start":76,"eind":79},{"woord":"s","start":96,"eind":97},{"woord":"zullen","start":105,"eind":111},{"woord":"zij","start":112,"eind":115},{"woord":"in","start":116,"eind":118},{"woord":"de","start":119,"eind":121},{"woord":"van","start":129,"eind":132},{"woord":"hun","start":162,"eind":165},{"woord":"hen","start":171,"eind":174},{"woord":"zal","start":175,"eind":178},{"woord":"en","start":188,"eind":190},{"woord":"hun","start":191,"eind":194},{"woord":"zal","start":206,"eind":209},{"woord":"hebben","start":217,"eind":223}]},{"ref":"zefanja/2/8","tekst":"Ik heb de beschimping van Moab gehoord, en de scheldwoorden van de kinderen Ammons, waarmee zij Mijn volk beschimpt hebben, en hebben zich groot gemaakt tegen zijn gebied.","woorden":[{"woord":"Ik","start":0,"eind":2},{"woord":"heb","start":3,"eind":6},{"woord":"de","start":7,"eind":9},{"woord":"van","start":22,"eind":25},{"woord":"en","start":40,"eind":42},{"woord":"de","start":43,"eind":45},{"woord":"van","start":60,"eind":63},{"woord":"de","start":64,"eind":66},{"woord":"zij","start":92,"eind":95},{"woord":"Mijn","start":96,"eind":100},{"woord":"hebben","start":116,"eind":122},{"woord":"en","start":124,"eind":126},{"woord":"hebben","start":127,"eind":133},{"woord":"zich","start":134,"eind":138},{"woord":"gemaakt","start":145,"eind":152},{"woord":"zijn","start":159,"eind":163}]},{"ref":"zefanja/2/9","tekst":"Daarom, zo waarachtig als Ik leef, spreekt JAHWEH van de legermachten, de God van Israël: Moab zal zeker zijn als Sodom, en de kinderen Ammons als Gomorra, een netelheide, en een zoutgroeve, en een verwoesting tot in eeuwigheid! De overigen van Mijn volk zullen ze beroven, en het overige van Mijn volk zal ze erfelijk bezitten.","woorden":[{"woord":"zo","start":8,"eind":10},{"woord":"waarachtig","start":11,"eind":21},{"woord":"als","start":22,"eind":25},{"woord":"van","start":50,"eind":53},{"woord":"de","start":54,"eind":56},{"woord":"de","start":71,"eind":73},{"woord":"van","start":78,"eind":81},{"woord":"zal","start":95,"eind":98},{"woord":"als","start":110,"eind":113},{"woord":"en","start":121,"eind":123},{"woord":"de","start":124,"eind":126},{"woord":"als","start":143,"eind":146},{"woord":"een","start":156,"eind":159},{"woord":"en","start":172,"eind":174},{"woord":"een","start":175,"eind":178},{"woord":"en","start":191,"eind":193},{"woord":"een","start":194,"eind":197},{"woord":"in","start":214,"eind":216},{"woord":"De","start":229,"eind":231},{"woord":"van","start":241,"eind":244},{"woord":"Mijn","start":245,"eind":249},{"woord":"zullen","start":255,"eind":261},{"woord":"ze","start":262,"eind":264},{"woord":"en","start":274,"eind":276},{"woord":"het","start":277,"eind":280},{"woord":"van","start":289,"eind":292},{"woord":"Mijn","start":293,"eind":297},{"woord":"zal","start":303,"eind":306},{"woord":"ze","start":307,"eind":309},{"woord":"erfelijk","start":310,"eind":318}]},{"ref":"zefanja/2/10","tekst":"Dat zullen zij hebben in plaats van hun hoogmoed; want zij hebben beschimpt, en hebben zich groot gemaakt tegen het volk van JAHWEH van de legermachten.","woorden":[{"woord":"zullen","start":4,"eind":10},{"woord":"zij","start":11,"eind":14},{"woord":"hebben","start":15,"eind":21},{"woord":"hun","start":36,"eind":39},{"woord":"zij","start":55,"eind":58},{"woord":"hebben","start":59,"eind":65},{"woord":"en","start":77,"eind":79},{"woord":"hebben","start":80,"eind":86},{"woord":"zich","start":87,"eind":91},{"woord":"gemaakt","start":98,"eind":105},{"woord":"het","start":112,"eind":115},{"woord":"van","start":121,"eind":124},{"woord":"van","start":132,"eind":135},{"woord":"de","start":136,"eind":138}]},{"ref":"zefanja/2/11","tekst":"Vreselijk zal JAHWEH tegen hen wezen, want Hij zal al de goden van de aarde doen uitteren; en ieder uit zijn plaats zal Hem aanbidden, al de eilanden van de heidenen.","woorden":[{"woord":"zal","start":10,"eind":13},{"woord":"wezen","start":31,"eind":36},{"woord":"Hij","start":43,"eind":46},{"woord":"zal","start":47,"eind":50},{"woord":"de","start":54,"eind":56},{"woord":"van","start":63,"eind":66},{"woord":"de","start":67,"eind":69},{"woord":"doen","start":76,"eind":80},{"woord":"en","start":91,"eind":93},{"woord":"uit","start":100,"eind":103},{"woord":"zijn","start":104,"eind":108},{"woord":"zal","start":116,"eind":119},{"woord":"Hem","start":120,"eind":123},{"woord":"de","start":138,"eind":140},{"woord":"van","start":150,"eind":153},{"woord":"de","start":154,"eind":156}]},{"ref":"zefanja/2/12","tekst":" Ook u, Moren! zult de verslagenen van Mijn zwaard zijn.","woorden":[{"woord":"zult","start":15,"eind":19},{"woord":"de","start":20,"eind":22},{"woord":"van","start":35,"eind":38},{"woord":"Mijn","start":39,"eind":43}]},{"ref":"zefanja/2/13","tekst":" Hij zal ook Zijn hand uitstrekken tegen het Noorden, en Hij zal Assur verdoen; en Hij zal Nineve stellen tot een verwoesting, droog als een woestijn.","woorden":[{"woord":"Hij","start":1,"eind":4},{"woord":"zal","start":5,"eind":8},{"woord":"ook","start":9,"eind":12},{"woord":"Zijn","start":13,"eind":17},{"woord":"het","start":41,"eind":44},{"woord":"en","start":54,"eind":56},{"woord":"Hij","start":57,"eind":60},{"woord":"zal","start":61,"eind":64},{"woord":"en","start":80,"eind":82},{"woord":"Hij","start":83,"eind":86},{"woord":"zal","start":87,"eind":90},{"woord":"tot","start":106,"eind":109},{"woord":"een","start":110,"eind":113},{"woord":"als","start":133,"eind":136},{"woord":"een","start":137,"eind":140}]},{"ref":"zefanja/2/14","tekst":"En in het midden van haar zullen de kudden legeren, al het gedierte van de volken; ook de roerdomp, ook de nachtuil zullen op haar granaatappels overnachten; een stem zal in het venster zingen, verwoesting zal in de dorpel zijn, als Hij haar cederwerk zal ontbloot hebben.","woorden":[{"woord":"En","start":0,"eind":2},{"woord":"in","start":3,"eind":5},{"woord":"het","start":6,"eind":9},{"woord":"van","start":17,"eind":20},{"woord":"haar","start":21,"eind":25},{"woord":"zullen","start":26,"eind":32},{"woord":"de","start":33,"eind":35},{"woord":"het","start":55,"eind":58},{"woord":"van","start":68,"eind":71},{"woord":"de","start":72,"eind":74},{"woord":"de","start":87,"eind":89},{"woord":"de","start":104,"eind":106},{"woord":"zullen","start":116,"eind":122},{"woord":"op","start":123,"eind":125},{"woord":"haar","start":126,"eind":130},{"woord":"een","start":158,"eind":161},{"woord":"zal","start":167,"eind":170},{"woord":"in","start":171,"eind":173},{"woord":"het","start":174,"eind":177},{"woord":"zal","start":206,"eind":209},{"woord":"in","start":210,"eind":212},{"woord":"de","start":213,"eind":215},{"woord":"zijn","start":223,"eind":227},{"woord":"Hij","start":233,"eind":236},{"woord":"haar","start":237,"eind":241},{"woord":"zal","start":252,"eind":255},{"woord":"hebben","start":265,"eind":271}]},{"ref":"zefanja/2/15","tekst":"Dit is die stad, die opspringt van vreugde, die zeker woont, die in haar hart zegt: Ik ben het, en buiten mij is geen meer; hoe is zij geworden tot woestheid, een rustplaats van het gedierte! Een ieder, die daardoor trekt, zal ze aanfluiten, hij zal zijn hand bewegen.","woorden":[{"woord":"is","start":4,"eind":6},{"woord":"die","start":7,"eind":10},{"woord":"die","start":17,"eind":20},{"woord":"van","start":31,"eind":34},{"woord":"vreugde","start":35,"eind":42},{"woord":"die","start":44,"eind":47},{"woord":"die","start":61,"eind":64},{"woord":"in","start":65,"eind":67},{"woord":"haar","start":68,"eind":72},{"woord":"ben","start":87,"eind":90},{"woord":"het","start":91,"eind":94},{"woord":"en","start":96,"eind":98},{"woord":"buiten","start":99,"eind":105},{"woord":"mij","start":106,"eind":109},{"woord":"is","start":110,"eind":112},{"woord":"is","start":128,"eind":130},{"woord":"zij","start":131,"eind":134},{"woord":"tot","start":144,"eind":147},{"woord":"een","start":159,"eind":162},{"woord":"van","start":174,"eind":177},{"woord":"het","start":178,"eind":181},{"woord":"Een","start":192,"eind":195},{"woord":"die","start":203,"eind":206},{"woord":"zal","start":223,"eind":226},{"woord":"ze","start":227,"eind":229},{"woord":"hij","start":242,"eind":245},{"woord":"zal","start":246,"eind":249},{"woord":"zijn","start":250,"eind":254}]},{"ref":"zefanja/3/1","tekst":"Wee van de ijselijke, en van de bevlekte, van de verdrukkende stad!","woorden":[{"woord":"van","start":4,"eind":7},{"woord":"de","start":8,"eind":10},{"woord":"en","start":22,"eind":24},{"woord":"van","start":25,"eind":28},{"woord":"de","start":29,"eind":31},{"woord":"van","start":42,"eind":45},{"woord":"de","start":46,"eind":48}]},{"ref":"zefanja/3/2","tekst":"Zij hoort naar de stem niet; zij neemt de tucht niet aan; zij vertrouwt niet op JAHWEH; tot haar God nadert zij niet.","woorden":[{"woord":"Zij","start":0,"eind":3},{"woord":"naar","start":10,"eind":14},{"woord":"de","start":15,"eind":17},{"woord":"zij","start":29,"eind":32},{"woord":"de","start":39,"eind":41},{"woord":"aan","start":53,"eind":56},{"woord":"zij","start":58,"eind":61},{"woord":"op","start":77,"eind":79},{"woord":"haar","start":92,"eind":96},{"woord":"zij","start":108,"eind":111}]},{"ref":"zefanja/3/3","tekst":" Haar vorsten zijn brullende leeuwen in het midden van haar; haar rechters zijn avondwolven, die de beenderen niet breken tot aan de morgen.","woorden":[{"woord":"Haar","start":1,"eind":5},{"woord":"zijn","start":14,"eind":18},{"woord":"in","start":37,"eind":39},{"woord":"het","start":40,"eind":43},{"woord":"van","start":51,"eind":54},{"woord":"haar","start":55,"eind":59},{"woord":"haar","start":61,"eind":65},{"woord":"zijn","start":75,"eind":79},{"woord":"die","start":93,"eind":96},{"woord":"de","start":97,"eind":99},{"woord":"beenderen","start":100,"eind":109},{"woord":"tot","start":122,"eind":125},{"woord":"aan","start":126,"eind":129},{"woord":"de","start":130,"eind":132}]},{"ref":"zefanja/3/4","tekst":" Haar profeten zijn lichtvaardig, geheel trouweloze mannen; haar priesters verontreinigen het heilige, zij doen van de wet geweld aan.","woorden":[{"woord":"Haar","start":1,"eind":5},{"woord":"zijn","start":15,"eind":19},{"woord":"geheel","start":34,"eind":40},{"woord":"haar","start":60,"eind":64},{"woord":"het","start":90,"eind":93},{"woord":"zij","start":103,"eind":106},{"woord":"doen","start":107,"eind":111},{"woord":"van","start":112,"eind":115},{"woord":"de","start":116,"eind":118},{"woord":"aan","start":130,"eind":133}]},{"ref":"zefanja/3/5","tekst":" De rechtvaardige JAHWEH is in het midden van haar, Hij doet geen onrecht; elke morgen geeft Hij Zijn recht in het licht, er ontbreekt niet; maar de verkeerde weet van geen schaamte.","woorden":[{"woord":"De","start":1,"eind":3},{"woord":"is","start":25,"eind":27},{"woord":"in","start":28,"eind":30},{"woord":"het","start":31,"eind":34},{"woord":"van","start":42,"eind":45},{"woord":"haar","start":46,"eind":50},{"woord":"Hij","start":52,"eind":55},{"woord":"Hij","start":93,"eind":96},{"woord":"Zijn","start":97,"eind":101},{"woord":"in","start":108,"eind":110},{"woord":"het","start":111,"eind":114},{"woord":"er","start":122,"eind":124},{"woord":"maar","start":141,"eind":145},{"woord":"de","start":146,"eind":148},{"woord":"van","start":164,"eind":167}]},{"ref":"zefanja/3/6","tekst":"Ik heb de heidenen uitgeroeid, hun hoeken zijn verwoest, Ik heb hun straten eenzaam gemaakt, dat niemand daardoor gaat; hun steden zijn verstoord, zodat er niemand is, dat er geen inwoner is.","woorden":[{"woord":"Ik","start":0,"eind":2},{"woord":"heb","start":3,"eind":6},{"woord":"de","start":7,"eind":9},{"woord":"hun","start":31,"eind":34},{"woord":"zijn","start":42,"eind":46},{"woord":"Ik","start":57,"eind":59},{"woord":"heb","start":60,"eind":63},{"woord":"hun","start":64,"eind":67},{"woord":"gemaakt","start":84,"eind":91},{"woord":"dat","start":93,"eind":96},{"woord":"daardoor","start":105,"eind":113},{"woord":"hun","start":120,"eind":123},{"woord":"zijn","start":131,"eind":135},{"woord":"zodat","start":147,"eind":152},{"woord":"er","start":153,"eind":155},{"woord":"is","start":164,"eind":166},{"woord":"dat","start":168,"eind":171},{"woord":"er","start":172,"eind":174},{"woord":"is","start":188,"eind":190}]},{"ref":"zefanja/3/7","tekst":"Ik zei: Immers zult u Mij vrezen, u zult de tucht aannemen, opdat haar woning niet uitgeroeid zou worden; al wat Ik haar bezocht hebbe, werkelijk, zij hebben zich vroeg opgemaakt, zij hebben al hun handelingen verdorven.","woorden":[{"woord":"Ik","start":0,"eind":2},{"woord":"zult","start":15,"eind":19},{"woord":"u","start":20,"eind":21},{"woord":"u","start":34,"eind":35},{"woord":"zult","start":36,"eind":40},{"woord":"de","start":41,"eind":43},{"woord":"opdat","start":60,"eind":65},{"woord":"haar","start":66,"eind":70},{"woord":"zou","start":94,"eind":97},{"woord":"worden","start":98,"eind":104},{"woord":"Ik","start":113,"eind":115},{"woord":"hebbe","start":129,"eind":134},{"woord":"zij","start":147,"eind":150},{"woord":"hebben","start":151,"eind":157},{"woord":"zich","start":158,"eind":162},{"woord":"zij","start":180,"eind":183},{"woord":"hebben","start":184,"eind":190},{"woord":"hun","start":194,"eind":197}]},{"ref":"zefanja/3/8","tekst":"Daarom verwacht Mij, spreekt JAHWEH, op de dag als Ik Mij opmake tot de roof; want Mijn oordeel is, de heidenen te verzamelen, de koninkrijken te verzamelen, om over hen Mijn toorn, de hele hitte van Mijn toorn uit te storten, want dit hele land zal door het vuur van Mijn ijver verteerd worden.","woorden":[{"woord":"Mij","start":16,"eind":19},{"woord":"op","start":37,"eind":39},{"woord":"de","start":40,"eind":42},{"woord":"als","start":47,"eind":50},{"woord":"Ik","start":51,"eind":53},{"woord":"Mij","start":54,"eind":57},{"woord":"tot","start":65,"eind":68},{"woord":"de","start":69,"eind":71},{"woord":"Mijn","start":83,"eind":87},{"woord":"is","start":96,"eind":98},{"woord":"de","start":100,"eind":102},{"woord":"te","start":112,"eind":114},{"woord":"de","start":127,"eind":129},{"woord":"te","start":143,"eind":145},{"woord":"om","start":158,"eind":160},{"woord":"Mijn","start":170,"eind":174},{"woord":"de","start":182,"eind":184},{"woord":"van","start":196,"eind":199},{"woord":"Mijn","start":200,"eind":204},{"woord":"uit","start":211,"eind":214},{"woord":"te","start":215,"eind":217},{"woord":"dit","start":232,"eind":235},{"woord":"zal","start":246,"eind":249},{"woord":"door","start":250,"eind":254},{"woord":"het","start":255,"eind":258},{"woord":"van","start":264,"eind":267},{"woord":"Mijn","start":268,"eind":272},{"woord":"worden","start":288,"eind":294}]},{"ref":"zefanja/3/9","tekst":"Zeker, dan zal Ik tot de volken een reine spraak wenden; opdat zij allen de Naam van JAHWEH aanroepen, opdat zij Hem dienen met een eenparige schouder.","woorden":[{"woord":"zal","start":11,"eind":14},{"woord":"Ik","start":15,"eind":17},{"woord":"de","start":22,"eind":24},{"woord":"een","start":32,"eind":35},{"woord":"opdat","start":57,"eind":62},{"woord":"zij","start":63,"eind":66},{"woord":"de","start":73,"eind":75},{"woord":"van","start":81,"eind":84},{"woord":"opdat","start":103,"eind":108},{"woord":"zij","start":109,"eind":112},{"woord":"Hem","start":113,"eind":116},{"woord":"met","start":124,"eind":127},{"woord":"een","start":128,"eind":131}]},{"ref":"zefanja/3/10","tekst":"Van de zijden van de rivieren van de Moren zullen Mijn ernstige aanbidders, met de dochter van mijn verstrooiden, Mijn offergaven brengen.","woorden":[{"woord":"Van","start":0,"eind":3},{"woord":"de","start":4,"eind":6},{"woord":"van","start":14,"eind":17},{"woord":"de","start":18,"eind":20},{"woord":"van","start":30,"eind":33},{"woord":"de","start":34,"eind":36},{"woord":"zullen","start":43,"eind":49},{"woord":"Mijn","start":50,"eind":54},{"woord":"ernstige","start":55,"eind":63},{"woord":"met","start":76,"eind":79},{"woord":"de","start":80,"eind":82},{"woord":"van","start":91,"eind":94},{"woord":"mijn","start":95,"eind":99},{"woord":"Mijn","start":114,"eind":118}]},{"ref":"zefanja/3/11","tekst":"Op die dag zult u niet beschaamd wezen vanwege al uw handelingen, waarmee u tegen Mij overtreden hebt; want dan zal Ik uit het midden van u wegnemen, die van vreugde opspringen over uw hoogmoed, en u zult u voortaan niet meer verheffen omwille van Mijn heilige berg.","woorden":[{"woord":"Op","start":0,"eind":2},{"woord":"zult","start":11,"eind":15},{"woord":"u","start":16,"eind":17},{"woord":"wezen","start":33,"eind":38},{"woord":"vanwege","start":39,"eind":46},{"woord":"uw","start":50,"eind":52},{"woord":"u","start":74,"eind":75},{"woord":"tegen","start":76,"eind":81},{"woord":"Mij","s